#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:2
#: c4332266e3f842cc912424ee842fcfe0
msgid "The TCP Server APIs"
msgstr "TCP 服务器 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:5
#: 769ff5b424d54086a70b199663089327
msgid "TCP Server setup API"
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:7
#: 2d81aa6d8ba84a868113fd9e08fc5c60
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is used to create a TCP server. The server in "
"the protocol is usually used to connect and listen to the TCP clients and"
" handle the data from the clients."
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 用于创建 TCP 服务器。协议中的服务器通常用于连接和监听TCP客户端并处理来自客户端的数据。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:39
#: ddc5d0f6bc1b4162af2bb49f6b25a031
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is defined in the ``TCP_Server_Base`` class. The"
" parameters of the ``__init__`` method are as follows:"
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 在“TCP_Server_Base”类中定义。 ``__init__``方法的参数如下："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:42
#: f1ffcdd5c8e74b9cbdb5e5fc8eeb34ce
msgid "``host``: The host IP address to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``host``：绑定 TCP 服务器的主机 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:43
#: 7e419c2e704a44228bd0bdeed976d861
msgid "``port``: The port number to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``port``：绑定 TCP 服务器的端口号。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:44
#: 854e298d71f140069b6ed51806224ca5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_clients``: The maximum number of concurrent clients the server can "
"handle (ignored when ``is_asynic_clients_io`` is ``True``)."
msgstr "``max_clients``：服务器可以处理的并发客户端的最大数量。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:46
#: 203462f6b127478cb9bb0c2093362827
msgid "``port_add_step``: The step size for incrementing the port number."
msgstr "``port_add_step``：增加端口号的步长。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:47
#: 3d0355b5c1924055a7d8b6acb907fad0
msgid "``port_range_num``: The number of ports to check in the range."
msgstr "``port_range_num``：范围内要检查的端口数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:48
#: a7852ea136454a1298541e96cdece1bc
msgid ""
"``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: The maximum number of threads for file "
"transfer operations."
msgstr "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``：文件传输操作的最大线程数。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:49
#: 0f1b0f03ffe2472cb58725dc446f6f7c
msgid ""
"``is_hand_alloc_port``: A flag indicating whether to manually allocate "
"the port."
msgstr "``is_hand_alloc_port``：指示是否手动分配端口的标志。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:50
#: 969ca405744f4d57a8e70db30eada3f7
msgid ""
"``is_input_command_in_console``: A flag indicating whether to input "
"commands in the console."
msgstr "``is_input_command_in_console``：指示是否在控制台中输入命令的标志。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:51
#: 6b01091b3f124b8d87c9423eb6998be4
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: The maximum number of custom worker threads."
msgstr "``max_custom_workers``：自定义工作线程的最大数量。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:52
#: c9d16d29465a48779ee2a54e4b9cc66e
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: A flag for extension protocols. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the constructor starts the server itself by calling "
"``start_TCP_Server()``; with ``True`` it does not, so an extension can "
"register its commands first and start the server later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:56
#: be13e03bfce24a5ca6e5733943a7db33
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: A flag indicating whether the messages exchanged "
"with clients are RSA-encrypted (see :ref:`tcp-server-encrypted-channel-"
"api`)."
msgstr ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``：指示与客户端交换的消息是否经过 RSA 加密的标志（请参阅 tcp-server-"
"encrypted-channel-api`）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:58
#: 3558d7e8c52442818701d4eb794b3643
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: An optional ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` pair of "
"user-supplied RSA keys. Both files must exist, parse as PEM, and pair "
"with each other; an invalid pair is silently ignored and the default key "
"lookup is used instead (``None`` keeps the default lookup)."
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：可选的``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` 用户提供的 RSA "
"密钥对。两个文件都必须存在，解析为 PEM，并且相互配对；无效的对将被默默地忽略，并使用默认的键查找（``None`` 保留默认查找）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:62
#: 86265e57f3aa48e58e3fb5d9de0a9277
msgid ""
"``max_mem_buff``: The in-memory buffering ceiling of the forward pump, "
"given in MiB and stored as bytes (``self.max_mem_buff``); past it the "
"uploading peer is told to pause. The default is 2048."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:65
#: 7d4dd6bf4eff4f4db8ce0187088f172c
msgid ""
"``recv_messages_chunk_len``: The number of bytes read per receive on the "
"control connection, covering commands and messages. The default is 4096."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:67
#: 8fb93ff5bf2f49b18f2f42c92e66123f
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_chunk_len``: The chunk size in bytes for streaming a file"
" or folder transfer in either direction. The default is 65536 (64 KiB)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:69
#: f12bacde2a874840879a51af63eeefde
msgid ""
"``is_asynic_clients_io``: A flag indicating whether clients are served by"
" asyncio coroutines on one event loop instead of one thread per client. "
"It lifts the ``max_clients`` limit, so a single server can hold thousands"
" of concurrent connections."
msgstr ""
"`` is_asynic_clients_io `` "
"：指示客户端是否在一个事件循环而不是每个客户端一个线程上由异步协程提供服务的标志。它取消了`` max_clients "
"``的限制，因此单个服务器可以容纳数千个并发连接。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:73
#: 3a36a9bba6004a41b358be9975788707
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: A flag selecting how much detail is logged. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the server logs command content and execution results only;"
" with ``True`` it also logs the key steps of the execution process."
msgstr ""
"`` is_debug `` ：选择记录多少详细信息的标志。使用`` False `` （默认值） ，服务器仅记录命令内容和执行结果；使用`` "
"True `` ，它还记录执行过程的关键步骤。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:76
#: be13e03bfce24a5ca6e5733943a7db33
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: A flag indicating whether the server logs at all. With "
"``False`` it prints nothing, whatever ``is_debug`` says."
msgstr ""
"`` is_print_log `` ：指示服务器是否记录所有日志的标志。对于`` False `` ，它不打印任何内容，无论`` "
"is_debug ``说什么。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:79
#: 2994b78415964ff0adc713a4daed1b6b
msgid ""
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar``: A flag indicating whether every"
" running file transfer is tracked in ``file_recv_progress`` (downloads) "
"and ``file_upload_progress`` (uploads). Each entry is a ``[transferred "
"bytes, total bytes, current speed, local file path, peer]`` list keyed by"
" the transfer's fid — ``peer`` is the ``(ip, port)`` of the transfer's "
"original sender (downloads) or receiver (uploads), never the relay of a "
"forwarded transfer. The entry is removed once the transfer ends; an "
"interrupted one keeps its entry (and its partial file) so the reconnect "
"logic can resume it. ``file_trans_progress_file`` names the file under "
"the protocol's ``.Flow`` directory these stores are written to when a "
"connection drops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:90
#: 9f9de22b50a94553ac1113f290dff1b4
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed``: A flag indicating whether the "
"protocol's real-time network speed is measured. With ``True`` (the "
"default) every send and receive — the control layer and every temporary "
"connection, file transfers included — feeds ``upload_network_speed`` and "
"``recv_network_speed`` (bytes per second, a rolling average over "
"``NETWORK_SPEED_WINDOW`` seconds). With ``False`` nothing is measured and"
" every speed value is ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:98
#: 8b0a1bb7ed944884854a936968f3b4bd
msgid "All parameters have default values:"
msgstr "每个参数都有默认值："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:100
#: 89299feb872b49758f7c9bf680114bbc
msgid "``host``: Default is ``'127.0.0.1'``"
msgstr "“主机”：默认为“127.0.0.1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:101
#: 38b84b10fc4d492497c3e0b20cb9fe8c
msgid "``port``: Default is ``65432``"
msgstr "“端口”：默认为“65432”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:102
#: 3ccf25b3de4749a7ad73a1001fea86fb
msgid "``max_clients``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_clients”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:103
#: 63455575485f4a25b4d2d2b83803e6b8
msgid "``port_add_step``: Default is ``1``"
msgstr "“port_add_step”：默认为“1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:104
#: d8759c586e7143838c1ffe24c9fd6f62
msgid "``port_range_num``: Default is ``100``"
msgstr "“port_range_num”：默认为“100”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:105
#: a8020929e0f14b5394b6dd502b7a7b67
msgid "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_file_transfer_thread_num”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:106
#: a9307e89f7cd471d96794bf7fbc9313c
msgid "``is_hand_alloc_port``: Default is ``False``"
msgstr "“is_hand_alloc_port”：默认为“False”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:107
#: 76084a80a458455bb952e8acad677eba
msgid "``is_input_command_in_console``: Default is ``True``"
msgstr "“is_input_command_in_console”：默认为“True”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:108
#: f32a6549330a43f482e01def905e7415
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_custom_workers”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:109
#: b423cc46e39340b1aa792d44e0157b60
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, ``__init__`` "
"will not call ``start_TCP_Server()`` automatically)"
msgstr "“is_extend_command”：默认为“False”（当“True”时，“__init__”不会自动调用“start_TCP_Server()”）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:111
#: 515932c230d64c88ab31d959cc694992
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: Default is ``True`` (when ``True``, client "
"connections go through an RSA public-key exchange and all subsequent "
"messages are encrypted)"
msgstr "“is_enable_encrypto”：默认为“True”（当“True”时，客户端连接将通过 RSA 公钥交换，并且所有后续消息都会被加密）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:114
#: c259e80f53a14b79a94190bcded7b30d
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: Default is ``None`` (a ``[pub_key_path, "
"pvt_key_path]`` list uses a user-supplied keypair instead of the default "
"``~/.ssh`` / generated keys)"
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：默认为``None``（``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` "
"列表使用用户提供的密钥对而不是默认的``~/.ssh``/生成的密钥）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:117
#: a8020929e0f14b5394b6dd502b7a7b67
#, fuzzy
msgid "``recv_messages_chunk_len``: Default is ``4096``"
msgstr "“max_clients”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:118
#: a8020929e0f14b5394b6dd502b7a7b67
#, fuzzy
msgid "``file_transfer_chunk_len``: Default is ``65536`` (64 KiB)"
msgstr "“max_file_transfer_thread_num”：默认为“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:119
#: 515932c230d64c88ab31d959cc694992
msgid ""
"``is_asynic_clients_io``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, every "
"accepted connection is served by a coroutine on one asyncio event loop, "
"and ``max_clients`` is ignored)"
msgstr ""
"`` is_asynic_clients_io `` ：默认值为`` False `` （当'` True "
"``时，每个接受的连接都由一个异步事件循环上的协程提供，并且忽略`` max_clients `` ）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:122
#: b423cc46e39340b1aa792d44e0157b60
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: Default is ``False`` (``True`` adds the execution-process "
"lines to the command/result lines)"
msgstr "`` is_debug `` ：默认值为`` False `` （ `` True ``将执行过程行添加到命令/结果行）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:124
#: b423cc46e39340b1aa792d44e0157b60
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` silences every line the "
"server would print)"
msgstr "`` is_print_log `` ：默认值为`` True `` （ `` False ``会使服务器打印的每一行保持沉默）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:126
#: abd7d3032e15468e92f96a0b5af1f926
msgid ""
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` "
"records no transfer progress)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:128
#: 9b2bfa874c4e4969905923bd7aa0f80c
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` "
"measures no speed; every speed value is ``None``)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:131
#: ff0d716f8c6344408337c57ab32bad28
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API will initialize all the necessary parameters and"
" resources for the TCP server."
msgstr "TCP 服务器设置 API 将初始化 TCP 服务器的所有必要参数和资源。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:134
#: 06c57226c0e9415ab1618ae20a14f513
msgid ""
"*Note: By default ``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` calls "
"``start_TCP_Server()`` to start the server automatically. If you set "
"``is_extend_command=True``, the instance will not auto-start and you "
"should call ``start_TCP_Server()`` manually when ready.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：默认情况下``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` 调用``start_TCP_Server()`` "
"自动启动服务器。如果您设置“is_extend_command=True”，实例将不会自动启动，您应该在准备好时手动调用“start_TCP_Server()”。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:145
#: e473a54dc4534e29ac4361429d24cb63
msgid ""
"In the `start_TCP_Server` method, we first create a TCP server socket and"
" bind it to the ``self.host`` and ``self.port`` which are initialized in "
"the ``__init__`` method."
msgstr "在`start_TCP_Server`方法中，我们首先创建一个TCP服务器套接字并将其绑定到在`__init__`方法中初始化的`self.host`和`self.port`。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:149
#: 68dff731e96c46788af52f9c536a6d2f
msgid ""
"*Note: The server socket which is set up in the `start_TCP_Server` method"
" is based on IPv4 form.*"
msgstr "*注意：`start_TCP_Server`方法中设置的服务器套接字是基于IPv4形式的。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:152
#: 1c6fc605850b4e988e7f5dac390f905e
msgid ""
"Secondly, according to the ``self.is_input_command_in_console`` "
"parameter, we will start a thread to listen to the console input of the "
"server or not."
msgstr "其次，根据``self.is_input_command_in_console``参数，我们会启动一个线程来监听或不监听服务器的控制台输入。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:156
#: 493d7ac50eb3446394da3c71f307b0a5
msgid "After that, a main loop to accept clients will be started."
msgstr "之后，将启动接受客户端的主循环。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:158
#: 46f0159fb9a84874959c103ac08656f5
msgid ""
"*Note: there is another global variable ``self.running`` which is set to "
"``True`` after the server socket is successfully created. The "
"``self.running`` variable is used to control the main loop of the TCP "
"server, and it will be set to ``False`` when the server is shutting "
"down.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：还有另一个全局变量“self.running”，在服务器套接字成功创建后，该变量将变为“True”。 ``self.running`` "
"变量用于控制 TCP 服务器的主循环，当服务器关闭时它将变为 ``False``。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:164
#: ed335af1339644a090d7fc4ebdc859f1
msgid ""
"With ``is_asynic_clients_io=True`` the main loop is the asyncio event "
"loop instead: it accepts clients in non-blocking mode and schedules one "
"coroutine per connection, it never applies the ``max_clients`` limit, and"
" `stop` releases it so the loop can end."
msgstr ""
"使用`` is_asynic_clients_io = True "
"``时，主循环是asyncio事件循环：它在非阻塞模式下接受客户端，并为每个连接安排一个协程，它从不应用`` max_clients "
"``限制，并且`stop`释放它，以便循环可以结束。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:169
#: 613624f457b847f994b739812b6e7aed
msgid ""
"The main loop of the TCP server setup function first checks whether the "
"number of connected clients exceeds the maximum number of clients. The "
"maximum number of clients is defined by the ``self.max_clients`` argument"
" of the `TCP_Server_Base` class, which is initialized in ``__init__``."
msgstr "TCP服务器设置函数的主循环首先检查连接的客户端数量是否超过最大客户端数量。最大客户端数量由“TCP_Server_Base”类的“self.max_clients”参数定义，该参数在“__init__”中初始化。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:174
#: d6142df9dee34a85a449a322bcfc5729
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the number of the clients is already over the limit of the connect "
"number, the server will send an overload message and close the "
"connection. But if it does not exceed the limit, the server will set up a"
" client handler function `handle_client` and the server handler function "
"is defined as:"
msgstr "如果客户端数量已经超过连接数量限制，服务器将发送过载消息并关闭连接。但如果没有超过限制，服务器将设置一个客户端处理函数“handle_client”，服务器处理函数定义为："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:186
#: e0d97e64db41406aa120fbdcd2ee5bb3
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the `handle_client` function, see the :ref"
":`tcp-server-handling-information-api` section.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有关“handle_client”函数的更多详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`tcp-server-handling-information-"
"api` 部分。*"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:189
#: 686ed007e14d4a98b931c0c651bb7bf5
msgid "So what can the setup function do if it fails?"
msgstr "那么如果setup函数运行失败了怎么办呢？"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:191
#: 189abee61a444611a486dec294da6561
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, the try-except block in the main server loop checks whether the "
"error is an ``OSError``. If it is, the main loop will exit directly."
msgstr "首先，主服务器循环中的 try 和 except 代码块将检测错误是否为“OSError”。如果是，主循环将直接退出。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:195
#: e4e1ba68f4b64dc280490157405acab9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Secondly, if the error is from the network socket, it first logs the "
"error message and also stops the server by calling the function `stop`. "
"And the stop function has been defined as:"
msgstr "其次，如果错误来自网络套接字，它会首先输出错误消息，并通过调用函数“stop”来停止服务器。停止函数定义为："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:204
#: 9eb5b6fb9d2e4394b3dbb4a1905767d0
msgid ""
"To stop the TCP server, it first sets the ``self.running`` variable to "
"False, to stop the main loop of the server. After that, it calls the "
"`free_port` function to free the port which has been allocated. And the "
"`free_port` has been defined as:"
msgstr ""
